Subject: [PATCH 07711/11362] [outer-loop] ARC re-authoring RESULT: goal
 induction 0/8 -> 4/8 correct, zero HUD fixation (REQ-ARC-WMTE-5834)

The re-authoring fix (retract HUD-band rules + name target + override framing) flipped
the end-to-end gate from 0 correct/2 partial/6 wrong to 4 correct/2 partial/2 wrong,
with ZERO games still fixating on the HUD. Correct on the 4 navigate/move-to-target
games (sc25/tu93/bp35/r11l) -- including 3 with no mover detected, because retracting
the wrong HUD rule alone stopped the fixation. Residual: overcorrects the 2 non-navigate
games (lf52 merge, ft09 CSP) into a navigate frame -> next: gate the player-target
assertion on mover-detected.

Complete measured chain: diagnosis -> oracle proof (0->7/8) -> detectors -> re-authoring
(0->4/8 from frames alone). Approaches the oracle's 7/8.

